| `RiskFinding` | Struct: `{ level, pattern, description }` — a single finding |
| `RiskAssessment` | Struct: `{ overall_level, findings }` with `should_block()` / `should_warn()` methods |
| `classify_risk(&DecodedExtrinsic)` | Main entry point — accepts decoded calldata, returns full assessment |

### Risk classification logic

| Call pattern | Risk level |
|---|---|
| Simple transfer (`transferKeepAlive`, `transfer`, `transferAll`) | **Low** |
| `Utility.batch` (transfers only) | **Low** |
| `Utility.batchAll`, `forceBatch` | **Medium** |
| `Proxy.proxy` dispatch | **Medium** |
| `Multisig.asMulti`, `approveAsMulti` | **Medium** |
| `Proxy.addProxy` / `removeProxy` (direct) | **High** |
| Unknown pallet/call | **High** |
| Batch containing unknown inner call | **High** |
| `batchAll` + proxy dispatch | **High** |
| `batch` + proxy mutation (addProxy/removeProxy hidden) | **High** |
| `batchAll` + proxy mutation (batch hiding attack) | **Critical** |
| Nested proxy (proxy wrapping proxy) | **Critical** |
| Proxy wrapping `addProxy` | **Critical** |

### Tests — 18 passing

All 18 test cases pass, covering: simple transfers, `transfer_all`, batch-of-transfers, `batchAll`, proxy dispatch, `addProxy`, `removeProxy`, multisig, `approveAsMulti`, batch-hiding (`batchAll` + `addProxy`), nested proxy, unknown calls, batch with unknown inner calls, proxy wrapping `addProxy`, `forceBatch`, risk level ordering, display formatting, and serde round-trip.
